# Added to what `vercel deploy` already skips (tools/deploy.sh). The CLI never reads .gitignore; it always skips .git,
# node_modules, .venv, venv and __pycache__ itself, and it adds this file to that list, so nothing is let back in.
#
# agent/ is the Python service on the GPU host (docs/06 §6.13): nothing in it runs on Vercel, and agent/.env holds its
# secrets (AGENT_SECRET and the sochitieu_agent database password).
/agent/
